# Push denylist for githooks/pre-push. Copy to
#     ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/agents-shared/push-denylist.txt
# and keep it there, untracked. It must exist: a missing file refuses every push that is scanned (a private repo's is not); a file
# with no entries lets pushes through, with a loud warning each time, since it guards nothing.
#
# One entry per line. Blank lines and lines starting with # are skipped.
#   name          matched case-insensitively as a whole word, anywhere in an added
#                 line, a touched path or a commit message
#   re:<ERE>      an extended regular expression, also case-insensitive
#
# Examples (placeholders, not real names):
# Example Employer
# example-employer.com
# re:example[-_ ]?client
